BEHAVIOR abs

DESCRIPTION
  Absolute value of a signed 64-bit integer.
  Branchless: mask = v >> 63 (arithmetic shift; all-ones if negative, zero
  otherwise), then result = (v XOR mask) - mask. For v >= 0 mask is 0 so result
  is v; for v < 0 this is the two's-complement negation -v.

CONTRACT
  INPUT value int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH b15b0b3a

IMPLEMENTATION
  v = LOAD value 8
  mask = SAR v 63 8
  t = XOR v mask 8
  r = ISUB t mask 8
  STORE result r 8
END
